ne\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 闭包捕获外层局部变量 count 的引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeCounter</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tcount </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\treturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tcount</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\treturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tif</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> q, err </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> divide</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); err </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10/2 =\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, q)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tnums </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sum =\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sumAll</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 切片展开传入可变参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tnext </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeCounter</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 11 12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>闭包捕获的是外层变量的引用，即使外层函数已经返回，只要闭包还存活，被捕获的变量就会逃逸到堆上继续保持状态。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"参数传递只有值传递修改外部状态靠指针\">参数传递只有值传递，修改外部状态靠指针</h2>\n<p>严格来说，Go 里所有函数参数传递都是<strong>按值传递（Pass by Value）</strong>。调用函数时，实参会被复制一份放进被调函数的栈帧里：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>传入 <code>int</code>、结构体或数组时，复制的是整个数据，函数内的改动对调用方不可见。</li>\n<li>传入 <code>&amp;x</code>（<code>*T</code> 指针）时，复制的同样是地址值本身；因为新旧两个指针指向同一块内存，通过 <code>*p = ...</code> 解引用就能改写调用方的原变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resetByValue</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tx </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resetByPointer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tif</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t\treturn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\t*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tn </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\tresetByValue</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"after resetByValue:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\tresetByPointer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&amp;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"after resetByPointer:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>解引用任意指针前先确认不为 <code>nil</code>，否则会立刻触发空指针 <code>panic</code>；切片、map 和 channel 在形参里能直接修改内部元素，也是因为复制的描述符里带着指向同一份底层数据的指针。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"包初始化与-init-函数的执行顺序\">包初始化与 init 函数的执行顺序</h2>\n<p><code>init()</code> 是 Go 保留的包初始化函数，不能接收参数、没有返回值，也不能被业务代码显式调用。单个 <code>.go</code> 文件里允许出现多个 <code>init()</code>，按源码从上到下的顺序执行；同一包下的多个文件则按编译传入的文件名字典序依次初始化。</p>\n<p>整个程序的启动初始化严格遵循下面这条依赖链：</p>\n<p><img src=\"/content-assets/go-functions-init-and-defer/assets/f52d210c5c5d-20231105142813.png\" alt=\"包变量、init 函数与 main 函数的执行顺序\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadConfig</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadConfig</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1. package-level var init\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\treturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"prod\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2. first init, config =\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3. second init\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4. main starts\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>包级变量初始化始终先于本包的 <code>init()</code>，而所有被导入包的初始化又先于当前包；一旦两个包互相 <code>import</code> 形成环路，编译器会直接报 import cycle 错误。</strong></p>\n<p>工程实践中只在确实需要向全局注册表登记驱动（如数据库驱动 <code>import _ \"github.com/go-sql-driver/mysql\"</code>）或校验静态配置时才写 <code>init()</code>，普通初始化逻辑优先写成显式函数由 <code>main</code> 调用，方便单元测试控制生命周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"defer-的压栈顺序求值时机与返回值交互\">defer 的压栈顺序、求值时机与返回值交互</h2>\n<p><code>defer</code> 用于把一条清理调用登记到当前函数返回前的延迟栈上，即使函数中间提前 <code>return</code> 或发生 <code>panic</code>，已登记的 <code>defer</code> 依然会被执行。多个 <code>defer</code> 按<strong>后进先出（LIFO）</strong>顺序执行：</p>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"defer-1\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"defer-2\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\ttrace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 输出顺序: body -&gt; defer-2 -&gt; defer-1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p>写 <code>defer</code> 最容易踩的两个坑，都和“什么时候求值”有关：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>参数在 <code>defer</code> 声明那一刻就完成求值并拷贝保存</strong>，之后原变量再怎么变也不会影响已经入栈的参数值。</li>\n<li><strong>闭包的变量捕获在 <code>defer</code> 真正执行时才读取</strong>，配合命名返回值还能改写最终返回给调用方的结果。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre data-language=\"go\" class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">package</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fmt</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> argEvalVsClosure</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tx </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 注册瞬间 x 的值 1 就已经拷贝锁定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"direct arg:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">\t// 闭包捕获变量引用，return 前执行时读到的是最新值 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closure var:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tx </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 命名返回值执行顺序：先给 result 赋值 -&gt; 执行 defer -&gt; 正式返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapWithNamedReturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\tdefer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t\tresult </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\t}()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\treturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 实际返回 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">\targEvalVsClosure</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\tfmt.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"named return:\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wrapWithNamedReturn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>记住 <code>return expr</code> 在 Go 里分成两步：先把 <code>expr</code> 写入返回值槽位，再逐个执行 <code>defer</code>，最后函数才真正跳回调用方；因此带命名返回值的 <code>defer</code> 闭包能修改最终返回值，例如在统一收口错误或 <code>recover</code> 时改写返回的 <code>err</code>。</strong></p>\n<p>另外要注意别在循环体里随手写 <code>defer file.Close()</code>，因为 <code>defer</code> 绑定在函数作用域上，要等到整个外层函数结束才会集中释放，循环次数多时会瞬间耗尽文件描述符。正确做法是把单次文件处理拆进独立子函数，让每次迭代结束立即触发 <code>defer</code> 释放资源。</p>\n",
